          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On November 5, 1989, a taxi driver observed for a few seconds the rapid passage of a bright point in the sky of Paris. A glowing, round object followed by a green trail crossed the sky. No other testimony was collected. The witness's description corresponds to the observation of a probable atmospheric reentry.",
